\fs32 \cf2 \cb3 \strokec2 Key Insight: Google's Veo 3 demonstrations show that integrated audio generation (dialogue, sound effects, music) creates a "step change" in perceived realism, but the remaining glitches\'97like crunchy spaghetti sounds or garbled subtitles\'97actually drive sharing behavior because they mark the content as AI-generated without falling into repulsion .\cb1 \
\cb3 Prompting Strategy: Use technical specifications that force the model into novel combinations not well-represented in training data (e.g., "1980s fitness video with models in leotards wearing werewolf masks" ). This guarantees the "jabberwockies" that signal AI authorship while maintaining visual coherence.\cb1 \
