\fs32 \cf2 \cb3 The Viral Formula for AI Storytelling:\
Based on analysis of 1M+ view AI shorts, the internal rhythm follows: Hook (3s) \uc0\u8594  Establish (10-15s) \u8594  Develop (25-35s) \u8594  Twist (10s) \u8594  Resolution/Payoff (remaining time) .\cb1 \
\cb3 Critical Difference from Traditional Storytelling: AI-generated viral content excels at "sensory-detail density"\'97impossible levels of visual intricacy that create what researchers call the "Slop Sublime": a mixture of amazement at the technical achievement and revulsion at the artificiality . This emotional paradox drives higher arousal than conventional narratives.\cb1 \
